<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 08:13:44 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>博茨瓦纳将获得国家特许开采矿山 5% 的免费股份</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/botswana-to-take-5-free-stake-in-mines-dug-on-state-concessions</link><description>博茨瓦纳将持有其新成立的勘探公司持有的勘探特许权开发的矿山5%的股份。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/botswana-to-take-5-free-stake-in-mines-dug-on-state-concessions'&gt;博茨瓦纳将获得国家特许开采矿山 5% 的免费股份&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Botswana to Take 5% Free Stake in Mines Dug on State Concessions&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/botswana-to-take-5-free-stake-in-mines-dug-on-state-concessions</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 07:42:11 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>马来西亚表示现在看到美国芯片限制的影响还为时过早</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/malaysia-says-too-early-to-see-impact-of-us-chip-curbs-video</link><description>马来西亚投资发展局主席兼马来西亚总理高级政治顾问扎夫鲁·阿齐兹认为，现在判断美国芯片限制的影响还为时过早。美国最近宣布将对新加坡、泰国、马来西亚、印度尼西亚和巴西的先进人工智能芯片出口实施更严格的控制。他与哈斯琳达·阿明就“哈斯琳达·阿明的见解”进行了交谈。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/malaysia-says-too-early-to-see-impact-of-us-chip-curbs-video'&gt;马来西亚表示现在看到美国芯片限制的影响还为时过早&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Malaysia Says Too Early to See Impact of US Chip Curbs&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/malaysia-says-too-early-to-see-impact-of-us-chip-curbs-video</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 07:48:37 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>由于人工智能担忧加剧科技损失，美国股指期货下跌</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/us-stock-index-futures-slide-as-ai-worries-fuel-tech-losses</link><description>由于全球科技股抛售继续令投资者担忧，美国股指期货进一步下跌。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/us-stock-index-futures-slide-as-ai-worries-fuel-tech-losses'&gt;由于人工智能担忧加剧科技损失，美国股指期货下跌&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：US Stock Index Futures Slide as AI Worries Fuel Tech Losses&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/us-stock-index-futures-slide-as-ai-worries-fuel-tech-losses</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 07:51:43 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>英国取暖费飙升26%，加剧通胀压力</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-25/uk-heating-bills-surge-26-adding-to-inflation-pressure</link><description>英国监管机构将能源价格上限提高 26%&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-25/uk-heating-bills-surge-26-adding-to-inflation-pressure'&gt;英国取暖费飙升26%，加剧通胀压力&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：UK Heating Bills Surge 26%, Adding to Inflation Pressure&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-25/uk-heating-bills-surge-26-adding-to-inflation-pressure</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 07:51:47 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>阿波罗收购迫在眉睫，易捷航空利润因伊朗战争而受到打击</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/easyjet-profit-hit-by-middle-east-war-as-apollo-takeover-looms</link><description>易捷航空表示，中东战争的影响侵蚀了该公司本财年的大部分利润，燃油价格飙升对这家廉价航空公司造成了打击，该公司正准备于明年初被一家美国私募股权公司收购。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/easyjet-profit-hit-by-middle-east-war-as-apollo-takeover-looms'&gt;阿波罗收购迫在眉睫，易捷航空利润因伊朗战争而受到打击&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：EasyJet Profit Hit By Iran War as Apollo Takeover Looms&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/easyjet-profit-hit-by-middle-east-war-as-apollo-takeover-looms</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 07:16:22 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>中国斥美国关税前景为“政治操纵”</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/china-dismisses-us-tariff-prospect-as-political-maneuvering</link><description>中国称美国对其出口征收新关税的前景是“政治操纵”，并表示两国应共同努力维持贸易休战。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/china-dismisses-us-tariff-prospect-as-political-maneuvering'&gt;中国斥美国关税前景为“政治操纵”&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：China Dismisses US Tariff Prospect as ‘Political Maneuvering’&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/china-dismisses-us-tariff-prospect-as-political-maneuvering</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 07:57:21 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>人工智能、美联储担忧加剧看跌情绪，金属跌势加剧</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/metals-mixed-after-major-selloff-as-traders-await-us-inflation</link><description>铜、铝和锡都加剧了周二金属的猛烈抛售，因为科技股扩大了跌幅，交易员们为美国通胀数据做好准备，这些数据将为美联储下一步的利率举措提供依据。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/metals-mixed-after-major-selloff-as-traders-await-us-inflation'&gt;人工智能、美联储担忧加剧看跌情绪，金属跌势加剧&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Metals Rout Deepens as AI, Fed Worries Fuel Bearish Sentiment&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/metals-mixed-after-major-selloff-as-traders-await-us-inflation</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 03:57:12 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>11 月 25 日最新石油市场新闻和分析</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-25</link><description>由于原油供应增加的迹象盖过了霍尔木兹海峡船只遭受的不断升级的袭击以及对该地区其他能源资产的袭击，油价下跌。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-25'&gt;11 月 25 日最新石油市场新闻和分析&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Latest Oil Market News and Analysis for Nov. 25&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-25</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 23:06:29 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>